{"n": 866, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "866.webp", "text": "4111530 REPLACING COVER FOR SIDE\nMEMBER LEFT OR RIGHT\n{Partial Replacement From Door\nPillar / Rear Side Panel Removed)\n— Convertible —\n\nRefer to information on page 41 - 001.\nRemove or cover up all car parts, which are\nlocated in the repair area or subjected to heat,\nsparks and dust.\n\nRemove rear side panel — see 41 35 111.\n\nMark cutting line,\nCutting line (A) must be at least 40 mm\n(1.575) away from door pillar connection,\n\nNote:\n\nMake the cutting line in such a manner when\never possible, that the jack holder will not be\ncut.\n\nCut off cover along marked cutting line.\n\n41-104\n\nDrill out spot welds.\n\nDrill out spot welds.\nGrind off welding beads.\n\nGrind off edge and lift off cover.\n3 Important!\nDon't damage the end piate.\n\nStraighten and grind all mating surfaces.", "words": [["4111530", 0.2624, 0.0663, 0.3121, 0.0769], ["REPLACING", 0.3262, 0.0656, 0.3891, 0.0769], ["COVER", 0.3931, 0.0663, 0.4306, 0.0769], ["FOR", 0.4357, 0.0663, 0.4574, 0.0769], ["SIDE", 0.4615, 0.0663, 0.4863, 0.0769], ["MEMBER", 0.3252, 0.0822, 0.3718, 0.0928], ["LEFT", 0.3769, 0.0822, 0.4037, 0.0928], ["OR", 0.4083, 0.0822, 0.4235, 0.0928], ["RIGHT", 0.4286, 0.0822, 0.462, 0.0928], ["{Partial", 0.3257, 0.0981, 0.3592, 0.1101], ["Replacement", 0.3637, 0.0988, 0.425, 0.1114], ["From", 0.4296, 0.0981, 0.4549, 0.1094], ["Door", 0.4585, 0.0995, 0.4823, 0.1094], ["Pillar", 0.3252, 0.1141, 0.349, 0.1253], ["/", 0.3546, 0.1147, 0.3561, 0.1253], ["Rear", 0.3607, 0.1147, 0.382, 0.1253], ["Side", 0.3855, 0.1147, 0.4058, 0.126], ["Panel", 0.4093, 0.1147, 0.4336, 0.126], ["Removed)", 0.4387, 0.1147, 0.4863, 0.126], ["—", 0.3262, 0.1366, 0.3323, 0.1386], ["Convertible", 0.3364, 0.1306, 0.3911, 0.1419], ["—", 0.3961, 0.1366, 0.4017, 0.1379], ["Refer", 0.2634, 0.1631, 0.2888, 0.1731], ["to", 0.2928, 0.1651, 0.3029, 0.1737], ["information", 0.307, 0.1631, 0.3637, 0.1737], ["on", 0.3673, 0.1658, 0.3789, 0.1737], ["pag